    <title>S1E1 萨满与灵性探索 追寻自我的精神旅程·对话焰木</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6628bd0ac3e09d8f37295fae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6628bd0ac3e09d8f37295fae</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 08:04:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>· 本节目由AJNA出品 ·</span></p><p><strong><span>🎙️嘉宾｜焰木</span></strong></p><p><span>萨满疗愈师，现代城市萨满研究者，图瓦萨满实践者，自然疗愈，University of Birmingham 心理健康硕士 小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64ce4a4e000000000b0068b9?xsec_token=YBVA_hhdVd0n8Dy7Tp2VJj3bvtWWZoGwaARM6mUyYsMRM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d3dd5c30000000012034375&amp;apptime=1748269528&amp;share_id=21a72cb2c7e34efca855e1e9f3ebaf64" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64ce4a4e000000000b0068b9?xsec_token=YBVA_hhdVd0n8Dy7Tp2VJj3bvtWWZoGwaARM6mUyYsMRM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d3dd5c30000000012034375&amp;apptime=1748269528&amp;share_id=21a72cb2c7e34efca855e1e9f3ebaf64"><span>焰木土豆</span></a><span> 微信yanmu9</span></p><p><span>🪬</span><strong><span>本期介绍</span></strong></p><p><span>穿越神秘的萨满文化，与传统习俗碰撞；城市与自然共同构成一个探索内心世界与精神疗愈的独特视角；都市女孩将先祖智慧与现代生活紧密结合，在萨满的力量中找到安宁；快来听听我们的故事吧！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYv330l6fWy6yzEz2J3I15Ls1FR.png"></figure><p><strong><span>🌈 内容提要</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 探讨城市萨满与传统萨满的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> 城市中的人与大自然的和谐共存之道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 与大自然的连接：重新发现内心的宁静与舒适</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 走进神秘的萨满文化：疗愈与超自然力量的探索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 探索萨满的能量奥秘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 实践才能消除想象中的疑虑，探索真实的存在。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 万物相连，探索内在的平等与尊重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 深入灵魂的呼唤，探寻萨满之路的自我发现与成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 探索灵性之路，拥抱情绪，超越灵性逃避</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2552">42:32</a> 沉睡的花朵，自然中的奇迹：一个无声的疗愈之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a> 通过萨满仪式获得内心的力量与治愈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 探寻灵魂碎片与内在小孩的整合之旅</span></p><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>主播｜Jolie</span></strong></p><p><span>美国QHHT二阶催眠师、萨满、心理咨询师，AJNA创始人，灵性博主，美国超个人心理学硕士。</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vn36HXqmowzyMa-5RE7nuA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vn36HXqmowzyMa-5RE7nuA"><span>公众号</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d3dd5c30000000012034375?xsec_token=YB9xKg2sM1tY1G8Luk9wrjAOoW7Uccc9rRN-GZGwUc0gQ=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d3dd5c30000000012034375&amp;apptime=1748315425&amp;share_id=98c5c72a08a945039f42a1f2ac199e38" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d3dd5c30000000012034375?xsec_token=YB9xKg2sM1tY1G8Luk9wrjAOoW7Uccc9rRN-GZGwUc0gQ=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d3dd5c30000000012034375&amp;apptime=1748315425&amp;share_id=98c5c72a08a945039f42a1f2ac199e38"><span>小红书</span></a></p><p><span>🪐</span><strong><span>互动方式｜</span></strong><span>如果你想成为下一位嘉宾或问Jolie灵性相关的问题，发邮件至📮JolieInnerHealing@outlook.com。如需转载/引用本原创播客所述内容，请注明出处。转载前请与「灵性酒馆」邮箱联系并取得同意。</span></p><p><span>✨</span><strong><span>本播客由AJNA出品</span></strong><span>，已同步更新在小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜Spotify｜Apple Podcast， 欢迎订阅，推荐给你的朋友。</span></p><p><span>- 更多 -</span></p><p><span>AJNA公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vn36HXqmowzyMa-5RE7nuA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vn36HXqmowzyMa-5RE7nuA"><span>AJNA阿那</span></a></p><p><span>AJNA小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64b94ef0000000001403eb43?xsec_token=YBFfObhn96g12amRGxGLC-VwyiPKUMWPgXDTrYVRL5Yuo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64b94ef0000000001403eb43&amp;apptime=1748315184&amp;share_id=f2d03cd96e1040f68faebafe50370992" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64b94ef0000000001403eb43?xsec_token=YBFfObhn96g12amRGxGLC-VwyiPKUMWPgXDTrYVRL5Yuo=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64b94ef0000000001403eb43&amp;apptime=1748315184&amp;share_id=f2d03cd96e1040f68faebafe50370992"><span>AJNA</span></a></p><p><br></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjsUT6pCZkkQN5_wumJ9t5G-NvAD.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
